  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Slice zucchini into thick half-moons.\n• Roughly chop onion.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Thinly slice kale, discarding any larger pieces of stalk.\n• Pick thyme (see ingredients).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a062473b75a6f3f15e806c-1382942b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place zucchini on a lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a062473b75a6f3f15e806c-95812487.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook onion and sliced mushrooms until tender, 5-6 minutes.\n• Add garlic and garlic & herb seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add risotto-style rice, vegetable stock pot, thyme and the water. Stir to combine. Bring to the boil.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a062473b75a6f3f15e806c-fc77dce1.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer risotto to a baking dish. Cover tightly with foil and bake until liquid is absorbed and rice is ‘al dente’, 24-28 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a062473b75a6f3f15e806c-a573ac1b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Remove risotto from oven, then stir through kale, Parmesan cheese, roasted zucchini and the butter. Season to taste.\n• Stir through a splash of water to loosen risotto if needed.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a062473b75a6f3f15e806c-0cf4d641.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide mushroom and green veggie risotto between bowls.\n• Garnish with flaked almonds and chilli flakes (if using) to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a062473b75a6f3f15e806c-3fa7299a.jpeg"
    }
  ]
